---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import LineChart from '../components/LineChart.astro'; import profile from '../data/profile.json'; import growth from '../data/growth.json'; import projects from '../data/projects.json';
const pct=Math.round(growth.study.total/growth.study.goal*100); const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
---
<Base><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL GROWTH OS · 2026</p><h1><span>{profile.name}</span><small>{profile.englishName}</small></h1><p class="lede">{profile.statement}</p><p class="motto">{profile.motto}</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href={`${base}/growth/`}>查看成长</a><a href={`${base}/projects/`}>查看项目 →</a></div><p class="nickname">Personal note · {profile.nickname}</p></section>
<section class="now section"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">NOW / 当前</p><h2>正在把长期目标，变成可见的日常行动。</h2><p>以下均为结构演示数据，等待刘映杰用真实记录替换。</p></div><div class="metrics"><article><span>考研学习</span><strong>{growth.study.total}<small> / {growth.study.goal} 小时</small></strong><progress value={growth.study.total} max={growth.study.goal}>{pct}%</progress><em>{pct}% · Example data</em></article><article><span>本周学习</span><strong>{growth.study.week}<small> 小时</small></strong><em>连续 {growth.study.streak} 天 · Example data</em></article><article><span>身体训练</span><strong>{growth.fitness.workouts}<small> 次</small></strong><em>累计记录 · Example data</em></article><article><span>篮球训练</span><strong>{growth.basketball.sessions}<small> 次</small></strong><em>{growth.basketball.hours} 小时 · Example data</em></article></div></section>
<section class="section split"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">PROGRESS / 进展</p><h2>不是状态截图，<br>而是一条时间曲线。</h2><p>未来只需修改数据文件，首页与成长页会同步更新。</p><a href={`${base}/growth/`}>打开完整仪表盘 →</a></div><LineChart values={growth.study.weekly} label="近 7 周学习时长" unit="小时 · 示例数据" /></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">PROOF / 作品</p><h2>用项目证明思考与执行。</h2></div>{projects.map(p=><article class="project"><div><span>01 · {p.status}</span><h3>{p.name}</h3></div><p>{p.problem}</p><p><b>当前结果</b><br>{p.result}</p><a href={`${base}/projects/#${p.slug}`}>阅读案例 →</a></article>)}</section>
<section class="direction"><p class="eyebrow">DIRECTION / 去向</p><h2>学习得更深，训练得更久，<br>做出能被验证的作品。</h2><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href={`${base}/about/`}>了解我正在构建的能力</a></div></section></Base>
